      <h1>Hi there, I’m Amirhossein Eskorouchi!</h1>

      <p class="home-lead">
        I am a <strong>Machine Learning and Optimization Researcher</strong>{" "}
        with more than four years of experience developing AI methods and
        intelligent decision systems. I am also an{" "}
        <strong>Industrial and Systems Engineering (ISE) Ph.D. Candidate</strong>{" "}
        at Mississippi State University (MSU), where I am fortunate to conduct
        my doctoral research under the guidance of{" "}
        <a
